  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Idk if its just me but I end up downloading the VRCSDK every other day even when its unesseccary, incase a new version came out.  I end up with like 10 downloads of the same VRCSDK.  So it would be a nice addition to the website if it said next to the VRCSDK when it last got updated.  I suggest this format I show in the picture.  I know you could check the announcements in the Discord but that still won't stop my paranoia from downloading it again to make sure lol.\n-Last Updated mm/dd/yy xx:xx am/pm (PST)",
